body:
[nitpick] The PR description mentions standardizing kebab menu behavior across DashboardCard, ChartCard, and SliceHeaderControls. However, SliceHeaderControls was not updated to use the new `KebabMenuButton` component like the other two files. Instead, the `VerticalDotsTrigger` was just inlined.

For true consistency, consider refactoring SliceHeaderControls to use `KebabMenuButton` with `iconOrientation="vertical"`:

```tsx
<KebabMenuButton
  menuItems={newMenuItems}
  iconOrientation="vertical"
  buttonId={`slice_${slice.slice_id}-controls`}
  dataTest={`slice_${slice.slice_id}-menu`}
  buttonCss={theme => css`
    padding: ${theme.sizeUnit * 2}px;
    padding-right: 0px;
  `}
/>
```

Note: This would require updating the component to handle the `NoAnimationDropdown` wrapper and custom `popupRender` logic, which may be outside the scope of this PR.

